{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 95,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        258.4885559082031,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Equity, acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.4222412109375,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "When considering the impact on health equity, the panel considered the treatment duration and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.2035522460938,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "the ability to decentralize treatment (to enable access for remote, underserviced settings and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        203.50411987304688,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "disadvantaged populations).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        137.92665100097656,
        527.0936279296875,
        152.36964416503906
      ],
      "text": "The GDG highlighted that health equity would probably increase for particular parts of the population",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975723266601562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        151.12660217285156,
        527.4013671875,
        165.56959533691406
      ],
      "text": "that would have access to the shorter regimen and the medications included (e.g. pregnant women",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        164.3266143798828,
        527.428955078125,
        178.7696075439453
      ],
      "text": "and children, and possibly other groups as well). On the other hand, certain populations might not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.52662658691406,
        527.4432373046875,
        191.96961975097656
      ],
      "text": "be able to afford the regimen, and there could be differences in impact on health equity among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        190.7266387939453,
        354.680419921875,
        205.1696319580078
      ],
      "text": "countries because of differences in availability of medications.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.4304962158203,
        527.536865234375,
        226.8734893798828
      ],
      "text": "Despite not being able to identify relevant research evidence, the panel used their collective experience",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949885368347168,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.63050842285156,
        527.4069213867188,
        240.07350158691406
      ],
      "text": "to judge that there would probably be advantages associated with the use of the BDLLfxC regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.8303985595703,
        527.4144287109375,
        253.2733917236328
      ],
      "text": "owing to its reduced complexity and shorter duration. The panel judged that use of the BDLLfxC",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.03053283691406,
        256.19964599609375,
        266.4735412597656
      ],
      "text": "regimen would probably increase equity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.73443603515625,
        527.1146240234375,
        288.1774597167969
      ],
      "text": "When considering the acceptability of the intervention, the panel considered patients and health care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982636451721191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        286.93438720703125,
        527.4410400390625,
        301.3774108886719
      ],
      "text": "providers as key stakeholders. The GDG considered the following aspects as critical with regards to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.1343994140625,
        527.438720703125,
        314.5774230957031
      ],
      "text": "acceptability: regimen duration and drug safety monitoring needs (relating to necessary travel, loss",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.33441162109375,
        527.4279174804688,
        327.7774353027344
      ],
      "text": "of income and general disruption of the life of patients; and workload for the health care system),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.5343933105469,
        527.4343872070312,
        340.9774169921875
      ],
      "text": "and needs for DST. The GDG highlighted that delamanid requires taking medicines twice per day",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.7344055175781,
        527.4366455078125,
        354.17742919921875
      ],
      "text": "in this regimen, which may affect acceptability. The panel judged that the BDLLfxC regimen would",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.9344177246094,
        181.37319946289062,
        367.37744140625
      ],
      "text": "probably be acceptable.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.6383056640625,
        527.1633911132812,
        389.0813293457031
      ],
      "text": "The GDG considered the following aspects to affect feasibility (i.e. to be potential barriers to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.83831787109375,
        527.1213989257812,
        402.2813415527344
      ],
      "text": "implementation): regulatory approval of drugs in the regimen, requirements for drug safety monitoring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949634552001953,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.0382995605469,
        192.9606170654297,
        415.4813232421875
      ],
      "text": "and requirements for DST.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.7423095703125,
        527.2073974609375,
        437.1853332519531
      ],
      "text": "BEAT-TB was a pragmatic trial. Similar intervention regimens have been given in other studies across a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969657897949219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.9422912597656,
        527.5546875,
        450.38531494140625
      ],
      "text": "range of countries, increasing the likelihood that the implementation of BDLLfxC is feasible in settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990446090698242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.1423034667969,
        249.48414611816406,
        463.5853271484375
      ],
      "text": "beyond the trial setting in South Africa.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.84619140625,
        527.5400390625,
        485.2892150878906
      ],
      "text": "Approval by regulators influences the access and feasibility of implementing the regimen; also,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.04620361328125,
        527.4573364257812,
        498.4892272949219
      ],
      "text": "alternative regimens are not always available. Access to some of the medications is hampered by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.2462158203125,
        527.378173828125,
        511.6892395019531
      ],
      "text": "licensing differences. For example, in the USA, there is no Food and Drug Administration (FDA)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.4461669921875,
        438.7810363769531,
        524.88916015625
      ],
      "text": "approval for delamanid, it is only available under compassionate use restrictions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.150146484375,
        527.4290161132812,
        546.5931396484375
      ],
      "text": "A few patients with low hemoglobin levels in the BEAT-TB trial received a blood transfusion before",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.3502197265625,
        527.3695678710938,
        559.793212890625
      ],
      "text": "initiation of treatment; the need for this may be a limiting factor in some settings for patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.5501098632812,
        178.6331024169922,
        572.9931030273438
      ],
      "text": "low hemoglobin levels.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        580.2540893554688,
        527.2615966796875,
        594.6970825195312
      ],
      "text": "Overall, given the reduced duration, complexity and associated workload, the panel judged that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.4541015625,
        236.15325927734375,
        607.8970947265625
      ],
      "text": "implementation is probably feasible.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.2654418945312,
        125.72310638427734,
        632.6204223632812
      ],
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.9692993164062,
        527.4150390625,
        654.3242797851562
      ],
      "text": "The BDLLfxC regimen is suggested over currently recommended 9-month or longer regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.971663475036621,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.1693115234375,
        215.4225616455078,
        667.5242919921875
      ],
      "text": "in patients with MDR/RR TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.0964965820312,
        325.3106384277344,
        696.9485473632812
      ],
      "text": "Evidence to recommendations: considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        704.1563720703125,
        527.622314453125,
        718.599365234375
      ],
      "text": "Based on the decisions taken during the review and the combination of assessments described",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3563842773438,
        527.4400024414062,
        731.7993774414062
      ],
      "text": "above, the new recommendation is to use the BDLLfxC regimen rather than the 9-month or longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.5565185546875,
        527.537109375,
        744.99951171875
      ],
      "text": "(18-month) regimens in MDR/RR-TB patients. The BDLLfxC regimen is intended for use under routine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983237266540527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.7565307617188,
        527.169677734375,
        758.1995239257812
      ],
      "text": "programmatic conditions, which include pregnant and breastfeeding women and children aged below",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961883544921875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  81",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}